> place feature hearthandharvest:nest 1550 -53 0
> place feature hearthandharvest:nest 1550 -54 0
> place feature hearthandharvest:nest 1550 -55 0
sleep 2
> zq count 1540 -60 -10 1560 -40 10 hearthandharvest:nest
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> execute positioned 1550 -55 0 if entity @e[type=hearthandharvest:crow,distance=..24]
look nest placed by the feature on the leaves (zq count >= 1) with 2 to 3 crows; else the manual generated nest below covers the refill part
