end
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> kill @e[type=hearthandharvest:crow]
> tp hcs5 1615.5 -60 0.5
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 300
sleep 40
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute positioned 1555 -55 0 if entity @e[type=hearthandharvest:crow,distance=..24]
expect (Test failed|Test passed, count: 0)
> pbot remove hcs5
